          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyirula khuPaulo naSiliwano naTimotseo; yule khukanisa yabaTsesalonika eyili muNyasaye Seefwe nende Omwami Yesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukoosia bube khwinywe, nomulembe, ebirula khuMwami Yesu Kristo, nende Nyasaye ouli, Samwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obukhalachi obulabaho olwa Kristo aleetsa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana beefwe, khukwanile okhumuupilanga Nyasaye orio khulweenywe tsindaalo tsiosi, shinga olwa kakhoyeele, shichila obusuubili bweenywe bukhulanga muno muno, khandi obuheeli bwabuli mundu khubashie bushilaananga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata ifwe abeene khwiyitsialilanga khukeenywe mutsikanisa tsiaNyasaye, khulwa obwisimilisii nobusuubili bweenywe mubusakanibwi bwosi nobusandibwi obwa mwifwilangamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwenobwo bulolosia ebulafu obukhalachi obulunjishi bwaNyasaye; bulachila mubasibwe abakwaniile obwami bwaNyasaye, obwamusaalilanga khulwabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liakhaba habwene khuNyasaye okhubarunga obusandibwi abo abamusandia inywe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nokhumurunga inywe abasandibwa, obusakulushi halala nineefwe, khukhufwimbulwa khwOmwami Yesu okhurula mwikulu halala nabamalaika bobunyalibwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mumemu tsiomulilo; olwa abakhalachila eshiina abeenabo abakhaya okhumumanya Nyasaye ta, kata abakhaya okhuhulila injiili yOmwami weefwe Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeenabo balanyoola omukuumo, mbu obwonooneshi bwobumeli, okhwahukhasibwa oburoola imbeli wOmwami khandi imbeli woluyali Iwobunyalibwe ta ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khunduukho eyo olwa aleetsa okhuheebwa oluyali mubatakatifube, nokhubahuchisia bosi abasuubila; shichila mwasuubila oburumbusi obwa khwamurumbulila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne niko akachila if we khumusaayilanga mbu Nyasave weefwe amubasie mbu muli abakwanile omulango kweenywe, khandi mbu yoosie mwinywe buli bwikombi bwobulayi nende buli shikhole shiobusuubili, mubunyali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu eliira liOmwami weefwe Yesu liheebwe oluyali mwinywe, nineenyu muye, obukoosia bwaNyasaye weefwe nende Omwami Yesu Kristo shinga olwa huli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
